<title>USA: Katy Industries Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Katy Industries Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.65		    $1.17</p>
<p> Net			  5,353		   10,264</p>
<p> Revs			55,128		   40,966</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,259		    8,766</p>
<p>   (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.64		    $3.18</p>
<p> Net			 13,716		   28,571</p>
<p> Revs		     188,518		  171,269</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,354		    8,986</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 includes gains of $0.45 a share in Q4 and $0.80 for the year from the sale of Union Pacific Corp shares. 1995 Q4 includes gain of $0.92 per share from the sale of Syratech stake and a gain of $0.11 a share from an insurance settlement.</p>
<p>1995 year includes a gain from of $1.48 a share from sale of Syroco by Syratech, a gain of $0.46 a share from restoration of Schoen's previously recorded operating losses, a gain of $0.48 a share from the sale of Union Pacific stock and a gain of $0.11 a share from an insurance settlement.</p>
